{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/10/2026bV6ZUUR4n81792996541.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>陳瀅（Jeannie）憑藉甜美形象與火辣身材一向深得觀眾喜愛，近日在熱播劇《璀璨之城》中的突破性演出更備受讚賞，人氣再創新高！日前適逢 Jeannie 的生日，她特別精心安排了一場極具儀式感的海邊浪漫慶生派對，並在社交平台上載了一輯唯美靚相與影片大派性感福利，瞬間引爆網絡熱話，融化無數粉絲！</p><p>\n<p>\n<img alt=\"4166b38a-f50a-468d-8672-008104043556.jpg.webp\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/10/2026kQ2ETgOCw71792996541.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/>\n</p>\n</p><p></p><p>從陳瀅分享的照片與影片可見，當晚慶生派對特別選址於海邊戶外餐廳，現場佈置極其用心浪漫，滿滿的粉橙色氣球海搭配精緻鮮花，加上背後迷人的海港夜景，氛圍感直接拉滿。</p><p></p><p>派對焦點莫過於女主角陳瀅的造型，當晚她身穿一套牛油果色的吊帶連身裙性感亮相，優雅中帶著一點小性感，將她的完美身材曲線與白皙肌膚展露無遺，散發出滿滿的女人味與女神氣場！</p><p>\n<p>\n<img alt=\"2d53fd27-be14-4db6-8cee-257860262573.jpg.webp\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/10/2026kyDrJCX6Zg1792996540.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/>\n</p>\n</p><p>\n<p>\n<img alt=\"3a15a2b0-0ed8-4d1e-b8b5-14985059e17d.jpg.webp\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/10/2026lfg53seXpk1792996540.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/>\n</p>\n</p><p>靚相一出，隨即吸引大批圈中好友及網民湧入留言區大讚並送上祝福。大家紛紛直呼：「Jeannie 生日快樂！越嚟越索」、「呢紮花同個人都咁靚」、「又甜又辣，美出新高度！」</p><p></p><p></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-26T07:20:48.659266+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":394,"images":4,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-26T06:38:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-27T10:38:20.501801+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-26T07:18:09.425929+00:00","content_hash":"581cf067c25aeffb1c566341e28825377c34fc64848d55185f5822e1b6bc799e","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-10-26T07:20:48.659266+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}